children, I write these things to you so that you may not sin. If anyone sins, we have a Counselor with the Father, Jesus Christ, the righteous."},{"verse":2,"text":"And he is the atoning sacrifice for our sins, and not for ours only, but also for the whole world."},{"verse":3,"text":"This is how we know that we know him: if we keep his commandments."},{"verse":4,"text":"One who says, “I know him,” and doesn’t keep his commandments, is a liar, and the truth isn’t in him."},{"verse":5,"text":"But God’s love has most certainly been perfected in whoever keeps his word. This is how we know that we are in him:"},{"verse":6,"text":"he who says he remains in him ought himself also to walk just like he walked."},{"verse":7,"text":"Brothers, I write no new commandment to you, but an old commandment which you had from the beginning. The old commandment is the word which you heard from the beginning."},{"verse":8,"text":"Again, I write a new commandment to you, which is true in him and in you, because the darkness is passing away and the true light already shines."},{"verse":9,"text":"He who says he is in the light and hates his brother is in the darkness even until now."},{"verse":10,"text":"He who loves his brother remains in the light, and there is no occasion for stumbling in him."},{"verse":11,"text":"But he who hates his brother is in the darkness, and walks in the darkness, and doesn’t know where he is going, because the darkness has blinded his eyes."},{"verse":12,"text":"I write to you, little children, because your sins are forgiven you for his name’s sake."},{"verse":13,"text":"I write to you, fathers, because you know him who is from the beginning. I write to you, young men, because you have overcome the evil one. I write to you, little children, because you know the Father."},{"verse":14,"text":"I have written to you, fathers, because you know him who is from the beginning. I have written to you, young men, because you are strong, and the word of God remains in you, and you have overcome the evil one."},{"verse":15,"text":"Don’t love the world or the things that are in the world. If anyone loves the world, the Father’s love isn’t in him."},{"verse":16,"text":"For all that is in the world—the lust of the flesh, the lust of the eyes, and the pride of life—isn’t the Father’s, but is the world’s."},{"verse":17,"text":"The world is passing away with its lusts, but he who does God’s will remains forever."},{"verse":18,"text":"Little children, these are the end times, and as you heard that the Antichrist is coming, even now many antichrists have arisen. By this we know that it is the final hour."},{"verse":19,"text":"They went out from us, but they didn’t belong to us; for if they had belonged to us, they would have continued with us. But they left, that they might be revealed that none of them belong to us."},{"verse":20,"text":"You have an anointing from the Holy One, and you all have knowledge."},{"verse":21,"text":"I have not written to you because you don’t know the truth, but because you know it, and because no lie is of the truth."},{"verse":22,"text":"Who is the liar but he who denies that Jesus is the Christ? This is the Antichrist, he who denies the Father and the Son."},{"verse":23,"text":"Whoever denies the Son doesn’t have the Father. He who confesses the Son has the Father also."},{"verse":24,"text":"Therefore, as for you, let that remain in you which you heard from the beginning. If that which you heard from the beginning remains in you, you also will remain in the Son, and in the Father."},{"verse":25,"text":"This is the promise which he promised us, the eternal life."},{"verse":26,"text":"These things I have written to you concerning those who would lead you astray."},{"verse":27,"text":"As for you, the anointing which you received from him remains in you, and you don’t need for anyone to teach you. But as his anointing teaches you concerning all things, and is true, and is no lie, and even as it taught you, you will remain in him."},{"verse":28,"text":"Now, little children, remain in him, that when he appears, we may have boldness and not be ashamed before him at his coming."},{"verse":29,"text":"If you know that he is righteous, you know that everyone who practices righteousness has been born of him."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/1john.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"1john_3","bookSlug":"1john","chapter":3,"reference":"1 John 3","title":"1 John 3 — Public Domain Study","topics":["1 john","1john","nt","scripture","約翰一書","约翰一书","彼此相愛","彼此相爱"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"你看父赐给我们是何等的慈爱，使我们得称为 神的儿女；我们也真是他的儿女。世人所以不认识我们，是因未曾认识他。"},"tokens":{"24":2,"62":1,"john":7,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"1john":2,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"約翰一書":1,"约翰一书":2,"彼此相愛":1,"彼此相爱":1,"你看父赐给我们是何等的慈爱":1,"使我们得称为":1,"神的儿女":3,"我们也真是他的儿女":1,"世人所以不认识我们":1,"是因未曾认识他":1,"亲爱的弟兄啊":2,"我们现在是":1,"将来如何":1,"还未显明":1,"但我们知道":1,"主若显现":1,"我们必要像他":1,"因为必得见他的真体":1,"凡向他有这指望的":1,"就洁净自己":1,"像他洁净一样":1,"凡犯罪的":2,"就是违背律法":1,"违背律法就是罪":1,"你们知道主曾显现":1,"是要除掉人的罪":1,"在他并没有罪":1,"凡住在他里面的":1,"就不犯罪":2,"是未曾看见他":1,"也未曾认识他":1,"小子们哪":2,"不要被人诱惑":1,"行义的才是义人":1,"正如主是义的一样":1,"犯罪的是属魔鬼":1,"因为魔鬼从起初就犯罪":1,"神的儿子显现出来":1,"为要除灭魔鬼的作为":1,"凡从":2,"神生的":2,"神的道":1,"存在他心里":1,"他也不能犯罪":1,"因为他是由":1,"从此就显出谁是":1,"谁是魔鬼的儿女":1,"凡不行义的就不属":1,"不爱弟兄的也是如此":1,"我们应当彼此相爱":1,"这就是你们从起初所听见的命令":1,"不可像该隐":1,"他是属那恶者":1,"杀了他的兄弟":1,"为什么杀了他呢":1,"因自己的行为是恶的":1,"兄弟的行为是善的":1,"弟兄们":1,"世人若恨你们":1,"不要以为希奇":1,"我们因为爱弟兄":1,"就晓得是已经出死入生了":1,"没有爱心的":1,"仍住在死中":1,"凡恨他弟兄的":1,"就是杀人的":1,"你们晓得凡杀人的":1,"没有永生存在他里面":1,"主为我们舍命":1,"我们从此就知道何为爱":1,"我们也当为弟兄舍命":1,"凡有世上财物的":1,"看见弟兄穷乏":1,"却塞住怜恤的心":1,"神的心怎能存在他里面呢":1,"我们相爱":1,"不要只在言语和舌头上":1,"总要在行为和诚实上":1,"从此就知道我们是属真理的":1,"并且我们的心在":1,"神面前可以安稳":1,"我们的心若责备我们":1,"神比我们的心大":1,"一切事没有不知道的":1,"我们的心若不责备我们":1,"就可以向":1,"神坦然无惧了":1,"并且我们一切所求的":1,"就从他得着":1,"因为我们遵守他的命令":1,"行他所喜悦的事":1,"神的命令就是叫我们信他儿子耶稣基督的名":1,"且照他所赐给我们的命令彼此相爱":1,"遵守":3,"神命令的":1,"就住在":1,"神里面":1,"神也住在他里面":1,"我们所以知道":1,"神住在我们里面是因他所赐给我们的圣灵":1,"belongs":1,"to":4,"the":8,"book":2,"of":5,"new":2,"testament":