sness. Sin is lawlessness."},{"verse":5,"text":"You know that he was revealed to take away our sins, and no sin is in him."},{"verse":6,"text":"Whoever remains in him doesn’t sin. Whoever sins hasn’t seen him and doesn’t know him."},{"verse":7,"text":"Little children, let no one lead you astray. He who does righteousness is righteous, even as he is righteous."},{"verse":8,"text":"He who sins is of the devil, for the devil has been sinning from the beginning. To this end the Son of God was revealed: that he might destroy the works of the devil."},{"verse":9,"text":"Whoever is born of God doesn’t commit sin, because his seed remains in him, and he can’t sin, because he is born of God."},{"verse":10,"text":"In this the children of God are revealed, and the children of the devil. Whoever doesn’t do righteousness is not of God, neither is he who doesn’t love his brother."},{"verse":11,"text":"For this is the message which you heard from the beginning, that we should love one another—"},{"verse":12,"text":"unlike Cain, who was of the evil one and killed his brother. Why did he kill him? Because his deeds were evil, and his brother’s righteous."},{"verse":13,"text":"Don’t be surprised, my brothers, if the world hates you."},{"verse":14,"text":"We know that we have passed out of death into life, because we love the brothers. He who doesn’t love his brother remains in death."},{"verse":15,"text":"Whoever hates his brother is a murderer, and you know that no murderer has eternal life remaining in him."},{"verse":16,"text":"By this we know love, because he laid down his life for us. And we ought to lay down our lives for the brothers."},{"verse":17,"text":"But whoever has the world’s goods and sees his brother in need, then closes his heart of compassion against him, how does God’s love remain in him?"},{"verse":18,"text":"My little children, let’s not love in word only, or with the tongue only, but in deed and truth."},{"verse":19,"text":"And by this we know that we are of the truth and persuade our hearts before him,"},{"verse":20,"text":"because if our heart condemns us, God is greater than our heart, and knows all things."},{"verse":21,"text":"Beloved, if our hearts don’t condemn us, we have boldness toward God;"},{"verse":22,"text":"so whatever we ask, we receive from him, because we keep his commandments and do the things that are pleasing in his sight."},{"verse":23,"text":"This is his commandment, that we should believe in the name of his Son, Jesus Christ, and love one another, even as he commanded."},{"verse":24,"text":"He who keeps his commandments remains in him, and he in him. By this we know that he remains in us, by the Spirit which he gave us."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/1john.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"1john_4","bookSlug":"1john","chapter":4,"reference":"1 John 4","title":"1 John 4 — Public Domain Study","topics":["1 john","1john","nt","scripture","約翰一書","约翰一书","上帝的靈和敵基督者的靈","神的灵和敌基督者的灵"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"亲爱的弟兄啊，一切的灵，你们不可都信，总要试验那些灵是出于 神的不是，因为世上有许多假先知已经出来了。"},"tokens":{"21":2,"62":1,"john":7,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"1john":2,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"約翰一書":1,"约翰一书":2,"上帝的靈和敵基督者的靈":1,"神的灵和敌基督者的灵":1,"亲爱的弟兄啊":3,"一切的灵":1,"你们不可都信":1,"总要试验那些灵是出于":1,"神的不是":1,"因为世上有许多假先知已经出来了":1,"凡灵认耶稣基督是成了肉身来的":1,"就是出于":1,"神的":13,"从此你们可以认出":1,"神的灵来":1,"凡灵不认耶稣":1,"就不是出于":1,"这是那敌基督者的灵":1,"你们从前听见他要来":1,"现在已经在世上了":1,"小子们哪":1,"你们是属":1,"并且胜了他们":1,"因为那在你们里面的":1,"比那在世界上的更大":1,"他们是属世界的":1,"所以论世界的事":1,"世人也听从他们":1,"我们是属":1,"认识":4,"神的就听从我们":1,"不属":2,"神的就不听从我们":1,"从此我们可以认出真理的灵和谬妄的灵来":1,"我们应当彼此相爱":1,"因为爱是从":1,"神来的":1,"凡有爱心的":1,"都是由":1,"神而生":1,"并且认识":1,"没有爱心的":1,"就不认识":1,"因为":9,"神就是爱":2,"神差他独生子到世间来":1,"使我们借着他得生":1,"神爱我们的心在此就显明了":1,"不是我们爱":1,"乃是":2,"神爱我们":1,"差他的儿子为我们的罪作了挽回祭":1,"这就是爱了":1,"神既是这样爱我们":1,"我们也当彼此相爱":1,"从来没有人见过":1,"我们若彼此相爱":1,"神就住在我们里面":1,"爱他的心在我们里面得以完全了":1,"神将他的灵赐给我们":1,"从此就知道我们是住在他里面":1,"他也住在我们里面":1,"父差子作世人的救主":1,"这是我们所看见且作见证的":1,"凡认耶稣为":1,"神儿子的":1,"神就住在他里面":1,"他也住在":1,"神里面":2,"神爱我们的心":1,"我们也知道也信":1,"住在爱