s love one another, for love is of God; and everyone who loves has been born of God and knows God."},{"verse":8,"text":"He who doesn’t love doesn’t know God, for God is love."},{"verse":9,"text":"By this God’s love was revealed in us, that God has sent his only born Son into the world that we might live through him."},{"verse":10,"text":"In this is love, not that we loved God, but that he loved us, and sent his Son as the atoning sacrifice for our sins."},{"verse":11,"text":"Beloved, if God loved us in this way, we also ought to love one another."},{"verse":12,"text":"No one has seen God at any time. If we love one another, God remains in us, and his love has been perfected in us."},{"verse":13,"text":"By this we know that we remain in him and he in us, because he has given us of his Spirit."},{"verse":14,"text":"We have seen and testify that the Father has sent the Son as the Savior of the world."},{"verse":15,"text":"Whoever confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God remains in him, and he in God."},{"verse":16,"text":"We know and have believed the love which God has for us. God is love, and he who remains in love remains in God, and God remains in him."},{"verse":17,"text":"In this, love has been made perfect among us, that we may have boldness in the day of judgment, because as he is, even so we are in this world."},{"verse":18,"text":"There is no fear in love; but perfect love casts out fear, because fear has punishment. He who fears is not made perfect in love."},{"verse":19,"text":"We love him, because he first loved us."},{"verse":20,"text":"If a man says, “I love God,” and hates his brother, he is a liar; for he who doesn’t love his brother whom he has seen, how can he love God whom he has not seen?"},{"verse":21,"text":"This commandment we have from him, that he who loves God should also love his brother."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/1john.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"1john_5","bookSlug":"1john","chapter":5,"reference":